            "review_title": "Review at Kg's Pizzeria at Blue Note Bar",
            "review_text": "Traveller12\nHanoi, Vietnam76 contributions\n1\nAwesome pizza on Doi Can\nJun 2017 • Solo\nI have been looking for a pizza joint in ba dinh for a long time. Finally found the perfect place ! Crazy prices and value for money, very good pizzas and it's open super late :) they speak English and German, and have a nice terrace at the second floor. And they deliver! I strongly advise this place!\nWritten June 29, 2017",
